ith Ephraim x Lyon and found your account through your older couple art. \n\nMay I request my character to be drawn as any mage outfit in the Fire Emblem series? Maybe the dark mage outfit from (FE:13) like Tharja if can't think of anything.\n\nI would like for you to draw my OC Cider. Cider has many hair styles, but she will always have pink diamond shaped pupils and hair that resembles cat ears. When her eyes are visible, her personality is very crass and she frowns a lot. When she has her long bangs and pigtails hair, she is always smiling.\n\nI'm glad I found your account! I would like to use this for SNS and YouTube. Thank you!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TbgCZHIr5ifrBfe1CmOUbT9eekOWht-6?usp=drive_link", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nanashi_kuno/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1145499, "client_id": 1958957, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c046cab7/uploads/origins/416e4d41-fc5c-4544-b9fd-e4b6e2b4f9cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1672edfca1a4157cc409f128434940b7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c046cab7/uploads/origins/416e4d41-fc5c-4544-b9fd-e4b6e2b4f9cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1672edfca1a4157cc409f128434940b7, https://si.imgix.net/c046cab7/uploads/origins/416e4d41-fc5c-4544-b9fd-e4b6e2b4f9cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fc0d9695acbc71efa2c7a6b089066d8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c046cab7/uploads/origins/416e4d41-fc5c-4544-b9fd-e4b6e2b4f9cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b16155e4d3651df08d8d81920d3e839 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c046cab7/uploads/origins/416e4d41-fc5c-4544-b9fd-e